        <item>
            <title>1.3.4</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:09:41 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://boa.decompiler.dev</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/txhaflaire/box-of-apples/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Improved clipboard sharing reliability between your Mac and virtual machines.

- Fixed missed clipboard updates and older contents overwriting newly copied text.
- Improved connection recovery, retries, and cancellation.
- Kept clipboard sharing responsive while guest commands run.
- Fixed GuestAgent hangs caused by large command output and added execution timeouts.
- Improved clipboard synchronization after suspending and resuming a VM.

Install **GuestAgent 1.2 (build 4)** inside your VMs to receive all improvements.
]]></description>
